    "body": "The default data folder is %LOCALAPPDATA%\\ClipRope. Open Storage & Privacy to see the active Data folder and its Disk usage. ClipRope stores history and Floating card positions on this PC. Referenced files remain in their original locations. Choose Browse… beside Data folder and select an existing, writable, empty folder on a local drive. A drive root, network share or path through a symbolic link, junction or other reparse point is not eligible. The destination must be separate from both the active history folder and %LOCALAPPDATA%\\ClipRope.Settings: it cannot equal, contain or sit inside either. Choose Restart now to start the move, or Later to keep using the current folder until the next launch. Use Cancel move to cancel a pending migration. If the path is marked as supplied by --profile, this session is using the separate history folder passed at launch. See launch options and uninstall choices. Disk usage shows the space allocated to recognized history data, backups, thumbnails and registered screenshots. It uses B, KiB, MiB or GiB (1,024 of one unit make the next). Unrelated files and unregistered screenshots are excluded, so the number can differ from the folder size in Explorer."
